  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut butternut pumpkin into thin wedges.\n• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with chermoula spice blend and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat.\n• Slice haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water. TIP: Peel the pumpkin, if you prefer!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a048c60ac954f02b194b81-f5f2eeff.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut capsicum into bite-sized chunks.\n• Cut beetroot into 1cm chunks.\n• Cut red onion into thick wedges.\n• Place capsicum, beetroot and onion on a second lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and season with salt. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a048c60ac954f02b194b81-8e7c8fac.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread the pumpkin and veggies out in a single layer.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• While the veggies have 10 minutes remaining, drain haloumi and pat dry. In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a048c60ac954f02b194b81-3ccd8ada.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 5 minutes remaining, boil the kettle.\n• In a large heatproof bowl, combine couscous and vegetable stock powder. Add the boiling water (3/4 cup for 2 people / 1 1/2 cups for 4 people). Stir to combine.\n• Immediately cover with a plate and leave for 5 minutes.\n• Fluff up with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a048c60ac954f02b194b81-1c2b222a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the couscous is ready, top with baby spinach leaves, roasted capsicum, beetroot and onion.\n• Drizzle with white wine vinegar and olive oil. Gently toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a048c60ac954f02b194b81-3642e91c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide couscous salad between plates. Top couscous salad with chermoula pumpkin and haloumi.\n• Dollop over chimichurri sauce and plant-based smokey aioli.\n• Sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a048c60ac954f02b194b81-f7df174e.jpeg"
    }
  ]
